  "details": "At this time i am not aware of any way to report someone’s avatar for copyright infringement. I am aware that avatar theft is a bit of an issue and having a way to file a DMCA report for people’s avatars would provide some peace of mind knowing that if someone DOES steal my avatar, they can be reported for it. Having that avatar be deleted from everyone but the owners list after a report has gone though would be great too just in case they had cloning on and it spread. Also please set avatar cloning to default to OFF not on",
